<p><img src="images/SubHead_Welcome.gif" alt="Welcome!" WIDTH="207" HEIGHT="38"></p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td width="20"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="35" height="1"></td>
    <td width="578">
	<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td valign="top">
						<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">March 28, 2001 <strong>Trakanon falls to LH and Friends!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=39"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=39&a=3"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">In what many would call our most exciting night in Norrath, Last Hope and friends swiftly defeated the mighty Trakanon!  Congratulations to all on a job WELL done!!   Grats to Grizztul on his Blood Ember BP, Lorrac on his Cloak of Piety, and Jarone, Fenya and Ashorty on Trak's teeth!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://lasthope-eci.com/viewscreen.php3?id=94">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=3">Fenya</a> <small>7:15pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">February 28, 2001 <strong>Rollie is a Superstud! Film at 11</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=37"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=37&a=22"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Rollie has been seen in Norrath and swoonin babes are reported eveywhere! Citizens are urged not to panic! Da swoonin effects last only a short while, and swoonin over Rollie is not considered a bad thing.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://www.lasthope-eci.com/viewscreen.php3?id=52">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=22">Rollie</a> <small>6:25pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">February 23, 2001 <strong>Coldain Ring of Eights owners ...</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=36"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=36&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">&quot;As far as the quests, the ninth coldain quest is in (that is why we were at work so late last night).&quot;<br>
<br>
-Esther the Tester</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://boards.station.sony.com/everquest/Forum3/HTML/006666.html">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>1:08am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">February 18, 2001 <strong>Sky Raid Completed!!!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=34"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=34&a=17"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Had a fantastic raid!! Thanks to everyone who helped make it possible!!! We were able to get epic items for Grizztul, Scarlita, Diggo, Biffen, Smarlg, Fenya, Dranak and Mordone, Virginiana and Iridiom completed their FAs, had some great drops for various classes and loads of quest items which some folks were able to complete quests with.<br>
<br>
Grats to all and thanks again!!!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=17">Diggo</a> <small>9:46pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">February 14, 2001 <strong>The Sky Raid is upon us!!! Whoohoo!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=33"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=33&a=17"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Our Sky raid begins tomorrow with those who can go up on Thursday. We'll see the rest of yall on Friday! Gonna be a great time! :)</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=17">Diggo</a> <small>11:27pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
